Hello Philip,
=C2=A0

What started as a small project during the pandemic has grown into a recipe=
 blog read by more than 1 million people every month=C2=A0=F0=9F=A7=91=E2=
=80=8D=F0=9F=8D=B3

Six years ago, like so many of us, I found myself=C2=A0spending a lot more =
time in the kitchen. That's when I decided to start sharing the recipes I w=
as testing at home on the Yuka blog.


I spent hours experimenting with healthier tweaks and taking photos - with =
a few fails along the way=C2=A0=F0=9F=98=85

The recipes quickly became a hit, and since then, the collection has grown =
considerably. The blog offers a wide range of healthy and delicious recipes=
, all available for free.


Today, I'd like to share four of our most-loved recipes on the Yuka blog=C2=
=A0=E2=9D=A4=EF=B8=8F

